<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" class="tborder" style="border-bottom: 0;">
	<tr class="titlebg">
		<td colspan="2" valign="middle" align="left" style="padding-left: 6px;">
			<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/topic/normal_poll.gif" alt="" align="top" /> Poll
		</td>
	</tr>
	<tr class="windowbg">
		<td width="5%" valign="top"><b>Question:</b></td>
		<td>
			Should the United States pull it's forces out of Iraq?
			<table>
				<tr>
					<td style="padding-top: 2ex;">
						<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
							<tr>
								<td>Yes</td>
								<td width="7">&nbsp;</td>
								<td nowrap="nowrap"><span style="white-space: nowrap;"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/poll_left.gif" alt="" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/poll_middle.gif" width="114" height="12" alt="-" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/poll_right.gif" alt="" /></span>3 (42.9%)</td>
							</tr>
							<tr>
								<td>No</td>
								<td width="7">&nbsp;</td>
								<td nowrap="nowrap"><span style="white-space: nowrap;"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/poll_left.gif" alt="" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/poll_middle.gif" width="152" height="12" alt="-" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/poll_right.gif" alt="" /></span>4 (57.1%)</td>
							</tr>
							<tr>
								<td>Screw it, I say we turn the whole country into a vibrant green parking lot, via a few high-yield warheads</td>
								<td width="7">&nbsp;</td>
								<td nowrap="nowrap"><span style="white-space: nowrap;"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/poll_left.gif" alt="" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/poll_middle.gif" width="1" height="12" alt="-" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/poll_right.gif" alt="" /></span>0 (0%)</td>
							</tr>
						</table>
					</td>
					<td valign="bottom" style="padding-left: 15px;">
					</td>
				</tr>
				<tr>
					<td colspan="2"><b>Total Votes: 7</b></td>
				</tr>
			</table><br />
		</td>
	</tr>
</table>
<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" align="center" class="tborder" style="border-bottom: 0;">
	<tr class="titlebg">
		<td valign="middle" align="left" width="15%" style="padding-left: 6px;">
			<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/topic/normal_post.gif" alt="" />
			Author
		</td>
		<td valign="middle" align="left" width="85%" style="padding-left: 6px;">
			Topic: Iraqi Depate Topic &nbsp;(Read 377 times)
		</td>
	</tr>
</table>
<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" class="bordercolor">
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=665" title="View the profile of Naithein">Naithein</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Hill Giant<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 227<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/44-knightman.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Rawr ?<br />
								<br />
								
								<a href="http://members.msn.com/laldayen@hotmail.com" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/msntalk.gif" alt="laldayen@hotmail.com" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://edit.yahoo.com/config/send_webmesg?.target=naithein%40yahoo.com"><img src="http://opi.yahoo.com/online?u=naithein%40yahoo.com&amp;m=g&amp;t=0" alt="naithein@yahoo.com" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="aim:goim?screenname=Lamdeir&amp;message=Hi.+Are+you+there?"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/aim.gif" alt="Lamdeir" border="0" /></a><br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=665"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.xanga.com/lamdeir" title="" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:laldayen@hotmail.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1656.msg18028#msg18028"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/question.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1656.msg18028#msg18028">Iraqi Depate Topic</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b> on:</b> December 11, 2005, 09:57:57 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Okay, I can understand people not wanting to be in Iraq because they think it&#039;s a waste of lives and money to the United States.&nbsp; I suppose that would go double for someone who has lost a relative over there.&nbsp; But consider this - we&#039;ve been over there 3-4 years and have lost 1/2 as many people as we did in one day (9/11). We&#039;ve lost 2000 or so Soldiers in 3-4 years, and believe it or not, there are that many murders in one major US city per year.<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; I can understand why some people would want to pull out.&nbsp; But if we did how long would it take for 9/11 to happen again? <br /><br /><br />Your thoughts? Arguements? Bashes? Flameas? Points?
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg18029"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=486" title="View the profile of Bobo">Bobo</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Splitpaw Gnoll<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 75<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/weasel.jpg" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Slay masta~!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=486"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1656.msg18029#msg18029"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1656.msg18029#msg18029">Re: Iraqi Depate Topic</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #1 on:</b> December 11, 2005, 12:20:32 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Most people are set in their mind one way or another. Few are swayed by opinions posted on message boards. Having said that I will offer a slight counter.<br /><br />The terrorist threat from Iraq was nil before we invaded. The correlation between those that were involved in 9/11 and Iraq did not exist. Iraq has now become recruiting and training ground for terrorist throughout the region.<br /> <br />The reason to go there has proven to be misleading and now politicians scrambling for new reasons.  All of our resources should of stayed in Afghanistan which is currently undergoing a Taliban resurgence.<br /><br />having said that - We are there and must finish the task at hand. To leave now would be a disaster. Examples of this include when we pulled support for Afghanistan after the Russians left which allowed the Taliban to take hold of that county. Ironic isn&#039;t it.<br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									&#171; <i>Last Edit: December 11, 2005, 12:26:09 pm by Bobo</i> &#187;
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=1171035" target="_blank"><img src="http://mysite.verizon.net/molex/sitebuildercontent/sitebuilderpictures/RotateFast1.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg18030"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=765" title="View the profile of Moraganna">Moraganna</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Hill Giant<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Female.gif" alt="Female" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 133<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/ceres.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Kiss muh cute ass~<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=765"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1656.msg18030#msg18030"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1656.msg18030#msg18030">Re: Iraqi Depate Topic</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2 on:</b> December 11, 2005, 05:44:14 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I think there was a time we should have pulled our troops out, that time has long since passed. I fear that if we even try to pull our troops out now it would be more devistating then us keeping them there. I may be wrong however, but that is my two cp. I don&#039;t know when we will be able to leave that country or if it will be another Germany/Japan deal where we keep a few of our military there. <br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><div align="center"><br /><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=847985" target="_blank"> <img src="http://home.mindspring.com/~jkocie/bb.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a> <br /><br />BUFF BISH {retired}<br />Moraganna Macabre<br />&quot;I don&#039;t know the the key to success, but the key to failure is trying to please everbody&quot;</div>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg18031"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
