								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1656.msg18031#msg18031">Re: Iraqi Depate Topic</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #3 on:</b> December 13, 2005, 11:15:20 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1656.msg18029#msg18029">Quote from: Bobo on December 11, 2005, 12:20:32 pm</a></div><div class="quote">The terrorist threat from Iraq was nil before we invaded. The correlation between those that were involved in 9/11 and Iraq did not exist. Iraq has now become recruiting and training ground for terrorist throughout the region.</div><br />To avoid a most certain flame, I will just say this;<br /><br />Do not comment on what you do not know.
						</td>
					</tr>
