								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1656.msg18045#msg18045">Re: Iraqi Depate Topic</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #6 on:</b> December 28, 2005, 10:14:33 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							hehe Happy Holidays all...<br /><br />Naithien - Am sure a lot of guys in Iraq and Afghanistan said the same thing you did in your last post regarding your after HS plans:)<br /><br />Good to see The Bobo writes still:) <br /><br />Take care of yourselves all my friends all over the world:)<br /><br />Always<br /><br />Zarie<br /><br />
